<title>CHINA: China crude imports soar 43 pct in Jan-July.</title>
<headline>China crude imports soar 43 pct in Jan-July.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>China's imports of crude oil in the first seven months soared 43 percent year-on-year to 17.71 million tonnes, customs figures issued on Friday showed.</p>
<p>Exports of crude rose 13 percent year-on-year in January-July to 11.45 million tonnes, the figures showed.</p>
<p>Customs gave no more details.</p>
<p>-- Beijing newsroom (86) 10-6532-1921; Fax 10-6532-4978</p>
</text>
